---
/* Vision, mission and product promise, word for word from the founder's "SoloFactory AI:
   Vision and Mission" statements. The vision also opens the page (Hero). */
---

<section class="section section--grey vision" id="vision" aria-labelledby="vision-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head section-head--center" data-reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow">Vision and mission</p>
      <h2 class="h2 vision__title" id="vision-title">
        Make sustainable business ownership <span class="soft">accessible to everyone.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="lead">
        We empower people to build, validate, grow and operate sustainable businesses through AI,
        making the capabilities of an entire team accessible to every entrepreneur.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="vision__grid">
      <article class="panel vision__card" data-reveal>
        <p class="vision__label">Vision</p>
        <p class="vision__statement">
          Imagine a world where anyone can own a company that pays them.
        </p>
        <p class="vision__lines">
          With or without a job. With or without a team. With the leverage of AI.
        </p>
        <p class="muted">
          So everyone has the freedom to spend more time living the life they love.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="panel vision__card" data-reveal>
        <p class="vision__label">Mission</p>
        <p class="vision__statement">Make sustainable business ownership accessible to everyone.</p>
        <p class="muted">
          We empower people to build, validate, grow and operate sustainable businesses through
          AI, making the capabilities of an entire team accessible to every entrepreneur.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="panel vision__card" data-reveal>
        <p class="vision__label">Product promise</p>
        <p class="vision__statement">One entrepreneur. One connected Brain. An entire AI workforce.</p>
        <ul class="vision__promise">
          <li>A Founder Brain that understands the entrepreneur.</li>
          <li>A dedicated Business Brain for every business.</li>
          <li>An AI workforce that helps move each business forward.</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>

    <p class="vision__close" data-reveal>More leverage. More ownership. More freedom.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .vision__title {
    max-width: 22ch;
  }

  .vision__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .vision__card {
    display: grid;
    align-content: start;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: clamp(24px, 3vw, 32px);
  }

  .vision__label {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 550;
  }

  .vision__statement {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.35;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .vision__lines {
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .vision__promise {
    display: grid;
    gap: 8px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .vision__promise li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 18px;
  }

  .vision__promise li::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: 0.7em;
    left: 0;
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--text);
  }

  .vision__close {
    margin-top: clamp(40px, 5vw, 64px);
    font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 36px);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    text-align: center;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .vision__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
